<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Privacy notice · {{ app_name }}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header><nav><a href="/">{{ app_name }}</a> · <a href="/es/privacy.html" lang="es">Español</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <h1>{{ app_name }} privacy notice</h1>
    <p>Last updated: <time datetime="{{ privacy_updated }}">{{ privacy_updated }}</time></p>

    <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
    <p>{{ app_name }} is published by {{ developer_name }}. Contact: <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>.</p>

    <!-- Replace each slot paragraph with the app's own text. Remove a section only if it does not apply. -->
    <h2>What data the app collects</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: what the app collects, or that it collects nothing.</p>

    <h2>How the data is used</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: purposes for each kind of data.</p>

    <h2>Where the data is stored</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: on the device, a server, or both; which country.</p>

    <h2>Sharing with third parties</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: services that receive data, or that none do.</p>

    <h2>Retention and deletion</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: how long data is kept and how a user deletes it.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: rights that apply and how to exercise them.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: the app's audience and age policy.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
    <p class="slot">TEMPLATE-SLOT-NOT-WRITTEN: how users learn about changes.</p>
  </main>
  <footer>© {{ developer_name }} · <a href="/en/support.html">Support</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
